jobs.description:
Objectives
- Support the Installation Design Manager;
- Perform survey on site (inside the train) and define the technical solution for the Electrical part;
- Report any failure of the Electrical solution during the train fitment in order to address the change in short term period;
Candidate Requirements
Educational Requirements
Master degree in Engineering school / university, specialisation or oriented in 
Electrical design
Desired Knowledge / Experience
- Knowledge of railways is an asset.
- Knowledge of Zuken e3 is an asset.
- - writing skills : clarity, rigor, and concision
- English, minimum FCE
- Danish language is an asset
Behavioural Skills / Competencies
- Team spirit and listening skills;
- Rigor and open-minded;
- Autonomy and perseverance;
- Goodwill and proactivity
